# Vulnerability Tsunami — isolation

`ops/vuln-tsunami/` is a **desktop-only** NVD monitor for the founder MacBook Pro.

## Forbidden

- Importing it from `app/`, `components/`, `lib/`, `scripts/`, `proxy.ts`, or any Next.js route
- Putting `NVD_API_KEY` in Vercel, `.env.local` of the website, or any `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` var
- Deploying the monitor with `www.dselevelup.com`
- Adding npm packages to the website root `package.json` for this monitor

## Allowed

- Editing files only under `ops/vuln-tsunami/`
- Local `.env` under `ops/vuln-tsunami/` (gitignored)
- macOS launchd agent via `ops/vuln-tsunami/mac/install-launchd.sh`
- Running `node ops/vuln-tsunami/check-isolation.mjs` before merge

## Output

Alert / report text must follow `.cursor/skills/i-have-adhd/SKILL.md`.
